window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He found me again. And this time, he will never let me go…</b></p> <p>Francis gave me two choices.</p> <p>Return to his side, and he will leave the pack alone. Stay with them, and he will do everything in his power to make them suffer.</p> <p>The choice was easy in the end…</p> <p>At least no one else will have to get hurt this way.</p> <p>Besides, it wouldn't be my first time down this road—heartbreak has been a constant companion in my life.</p> <p>But I know that Pack Snow will go on without me; Rian, Jeremy, Leo, and Troy will find their happiness again.</p> <p>They already have everything they could need. In the end, I would have just become a burden.</p> <p>I know how to survive being starved, and I will find a way to live through this sacrifice, too.</p> <p>Sacrificed <i>is a contemporary Omegaverse about a touch-starved Omega that will take you on an emotional rollercoaster from start to finish. There is no choosing, and scenes of MM/ MMFM. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
